 ## Rental service
 
 `createRentalService()` creates an isolated in-memory rental inventory. Add boards or sails with a
-daily price in integer euro cents, then quote or book a period using UTC ISO-8601 timestamps at
-midnight. The end timestamp is exclusive, so a rental from one midnight to the next is one day.
-Rentals of three or more days receive a 10% discount from the full period price. Discounted totals
-are rounded to the nearest euro cent, with half cents rounded up. Both quotes and bookings report
-that same reduced total.
+daily price in integer euro cents and, optionally, an hourly price. Whole-day rentals use UTC
+ISO-8601 timestamps at midnight. Rentals shorter than a day may start and end on the hour, and need
+an hourly price; each hour is charged at that rate. End timestamps are exclusive. Rentals of three
+or more days receive a 10% discount from the full period price. Discounted totals are rounded to the
+nearest euro cent, with half cents rounded up. Both quotes and bookings report the same total.
 Bookings for the same item cannot overlap. Cancellation and refunds are not available yet.
 
