+---
+id: sw-life-cycle-1-4-plan
+type: plan
+title: "Hourly equipment rentals"
+status: active
+workflow: "sw-life-cycle"
+phase: "1-4"
+element: ""
+parent: ""
+format: 1
+---
+
+Added optional `hourlyPrice` support to equipment. Quotes and bookings accept sub-day periods that
+start and end on the UTC hour, charge each hour at that rate, and reject items without an hourly
+price. Whole-day periods retain daily pricing and the existing long-rental discount. Availability
+queries remain midnight-to-midnight. Updated the README example. `git diff --check` passed; tests were
+not run.
