+---
+id: task-004-add-hourly-equipment-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Add hourly equipment rentals"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Extend equipment with an optional hourly price in integer euro cents. Allow rentals shorter than a
+day when their UTC start and end timestamps are on the hour, charging hourly price per hour. Such
+rentals require an hourly price. Preserve whole-day rental pricing and discount behavior; validate
+hourly prices and time periods, and cover hourly quotes and bookings.
